# Monorepo Conventions

## Structure

- `qspqi-web-main/` — Portal (submodule)
- `qspqi-web-hioxx/` — HIOXX calculator (submodule)
- No shared packages; each submodule is an independent Vite project

## Rules

- Never create cross-imports between submodules
- Business specs live in the relevant submodule (`qspqi-web-hioxx/docs/specs/`)
- Shared branding (colors, fonts) is duplicated intentionally — keep in sync manually
- Use docker-compose from monorepo root for local dev
- HIOXX is embedded in main via iframe at `/hioxx`

## Agent Context

- Monorepo-level: `AGENTS.md`, `docs/MONOREPO.md`
- HIOXX-specific: `qspqi-web-hioxx/AGENTS.md`, `qspqi-web-hioxx/docs/specs/`
